<search_and_reading>
Gather information once, then act. Use `list_dir` and `bulk_grep_search` to locate relevant files, then read ONLY the files you will edit or whose values you need. Each file read becomes permanent knowledge for the rest of the task.

When the user message is an error report from a previous apply, the error names the file and resource: the files you saw earlier are unchanged except by your own edits, so you typically need zero or one new reads before fixing it.

